A match over an enum where one value is neither keyed nor accepted by the
target.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	kind: "a" | "b" | "c"
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	kind: "a" | "b"
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		kind: match(v0_0.kind, {
			"a": "b"
		})
	}
}
-- out/error --
match on kind is not exhaustive: 0.0's kind may be "c", which no arm matches and 1.0's kind does not accept; add an arm for it, or a [_] arm:
    1.0.thema:8:9
